          </div>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td className="px-6 py-4">
        <span className={`inline-flex items-center px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium ${
          client.status === 'Aktif' ? 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700' : 'bg-red-100 text-red-700'
